---
title: "withdrawInvestedCapitalIfCanceled (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_guard: whenNotPaused AND whenSaleCanceled
    q_guard --> q_get_pos: guards pass
    q_get_pos --> q_verify_exists: positionId = _getInvestorPositionId(msg.sender)
    q_verify_exists --> q_verify_refund: _verifyPositionExists(positionId)
    q_verify_refund --> q_cache: _verifyHasNotRefunded(positionId)
    q_cache --> q_check_zero: amountToWithdraw = investedCapital
    q_check_zero --> q_revert_zero: amountToWithdraw == 0
    q_revert_zero --> [*]: revert LegionSale__InvalidWithdrawAmount(0)
    q_check_zero --> q_zero: amountToWithdraw > 0
    q_zero --> q_decrement: investedCapital = 0
    q_decrement --> q_emit: totalCapitalInvested -= amountToWithdraw
    q_emit --> q_transfer: emit CapitalRefundedAfterCancel(amountToWithdraw, msg.sender, positionId)
    q_transfer --> [*]: safeTransfer(bidToken, msg.sender, amountToWithdraw)

    note right of q_zero
        INV-001: only callable when sale is canceled
        INV-002: full invested capital returned
        INV-003: state zeroed before transfer (reentrancy safe)
    end note
